    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40473" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίπεμπτος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
		Math., =
		<i><span class="en">
			1
		</span></i>+<i><span class="en">
			1
		</span></i>/<i><span class="en">
			5
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Nicom.
			<u>Ar.</u>
			1.22
		</span></i>, etc. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>. of loans
				<i>bearing interest at the rate of</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>/<i><span class="en">
				5
			</span></i>
			<i>of the principal</i>, i.e.<i><span class="en">
				20
			</span></i> per cent., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναυτικὸν</span>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ</span>. <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Vect.</u>
				3.9
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>. 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέμπτος</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Eup.
				65
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Le.</u>
				5.16
			</span></i>, al.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοὐπίπεμπτον</span>
			<i>one-fifth</i> of the votes in a trial, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				201
			</span></i>.</div>
